# Four pairs of loops stand side by side in the turn of one loop, and each loop holds a loop. One of a pair grows a text, the other is only found quiet: they do not wish for the same thing. The walks grow with the
# width by a line: fifteen a pair and three, as its twin of eight pairs shows.
# RUN: compile WalksOfLoops mechanisms=all
# CHECK: statistic WalksOfLoops 63
